###  Commits on Jun 19, 2026 

  * ####  [ Read Sinhala ZWJ conjunct clusters as a single conjunct ](/espeak-ng/espeak-ng/commit/2e04c5497ac877532cdfcf0b0e68e166f8057414 "Read Sinhala ZWJ conjunct clusters as a single conjunct

Sinhala touching conjuncts \(e.g. ක්‍ර\) are encoded as consonant + virama
\(U+0DCA\) + zero-width-joiner \(U+200D\) + consonant. The ZWJ only selects a
touching-conjunct glyph and has no effect on pronunciation, but it was not
ignored for Sinhala, so the cluster was split: ක්‍ර produced ")

